     A*                                     FLDREF - common field reference.
     A*                                     Part 5 (legacy). QDDSSRC.
     A*                                     NOT compiled on real hardware
     A*                                     yet (SSH connection budget is
     A*                                     exhausted this session).
     A*
     A*                                     REFFLD target only: other DDS
     A*                                     are meant to reference these
     A*                                     fields with REFFLD(name FLDREF).
     A*                                     FLDREF itself never uses REFFLD.
     A*
     A*                                     UNVERIFIED: no DDS Reference doc
     A*                                     is in this repo's work/design/
     A*                                     refs (7 docs there; none is a
     A*                                     DDS Reference. Only secref75.txt
     A*                                     mentions REFFLD, in an authority
     A*                                     table, not its syntax/usage).
     A*                                     Zero actual REFFLD referrers
     A*                                     exist yet: db/v2/juchum.pf still
     A*                                     inlines JUNO/JUTOK rather than
     A*                                     using REFFLD. Confirm REFFLD's
     A*                                     real syntax on the next real-
     A*                                     machine connection or doc pull
     A*                                     (see design.json openQuestions,
     A*                                     itself local-only: work/ is
     A*                                     gitignored in this repo).
     A*
     A*                                     See FLDREFR (QRPGSRC) for the
     A*                                     matching RPG III /COPY member of
     A*                                     these same field names, and
     A*                                     scripts/check-fldref-fldrefr-
     A*                                     consistency.mjs for the
     A*                                     permanent name/length/type/dec
     A*                                     check between the two files.
     A          R FLDREFD                   TEXT('Common field definitions')
     A            TOKCD          6A         TEXT('Customer code')
     A            TOKNM         30A         TEXT('Customer name')
     A            JUNO           6A         TEXT('Order number')
     A            JUTOK          6A         TEXT('Customer code')
     A            JUSHO          6A         TEXT('Product code')
     A            JUSU           5S 0       TEXT('Quantity')
     A            ZASHO          6A         TEXT('Product code')
     A            ZASU           7S 0       TEXT('Stock quantity')
